{"name":"Teen Queen","hex":"#a67498","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"teen","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Synonym of teenager: a person between 13 and 19 years old (inclusive).","A black teenager or a young black person."]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Of or having to do with teenagers; teenage"]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/teen"},{"term":"queen","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The wife, consort, or widow of a king.","A female monarch."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To act the part of a queen; to behave imperiously; to queen it.","To make a queen or (figuratively) to give the status of a queen."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/queen"}],"entries":[{"title":"Petra Marklund","blocks":[{"text":"Petra Linnea Paula Marklund, known also by her previous stage name September, is a Swedish singer, songwriter, and television presenter. Marklund started recording in professional studios around the age of twelve, and first came to the attention of the music scene with September's debut single \"La La La \" in 2003, released from her studio album September (2004)."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/66/Petra_Marklund%2C_June_2015.jpg/330px-Petra_Marklund%2C_June_2015.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Petra_Marklund"},{"title":"Adolescence","blocks":[{"text":"Adolescence is a transitional stage of human physical and psychological development that generally occurs during the period from puberty to adulthood. Adolescence is usually associated with the teenage years, but its physical, psychological or cultural expressions may begin earlier or end later. Puberty typically begins during preadolescence, particularly in females. Physical growth and cognitive development can extend past the teens. Age provides only a rough marker of adolescence, and scholars have not agreed upon a precise definition. Some definitions start as early as 10 and end as late as 30. The World Health Organization definition officially designates adolescence as the phase of life from ages 10 to 19."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c6/Teens_sharing_a_song.jpg/330px-Teens_sharing_a_song.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Adolescence"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f4/Petra_%27September%27_Marklund.jpg/500px-Petra_%27September%27_Marklund.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f4/Petra_%27September%27_Marklund.jpg/1280px-Petra_%27September%27_Marklund.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f4/Petra_%27September%27_Marklund.jpg/500px-Petra_%27September%27_Marklund.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Petra Marklund in 2008","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3APetra_'September'_Marklund.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2b/Petra_Marklund.jpg/500px-Petra_Marklund.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2b/Petra_Marklund.jpg/500px-Petra_Marklund.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Petra Marklund at the Grammis Awards in 2013","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3APetra_Marklund.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2a/Views_of_a_Foetus_in_the_Womb_detail.jpg/330px-Views_of_a_Foetus_in_the_Womb_detail.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2a/Views_of_a_Foetus_in_the_